  "fields": {
    "title": "Hover",
    "textContent": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Description",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "The ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "CSS",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " hover ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "5Bkgv1nIW5RZKf91msljGo",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "pseudo-class",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " makes it possible to style a html element differently when users hovers over it with their cursor. So hover makes it easy to add an interactive touch to your design. When someone moves their mouse over an element, such as a ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "FLAhUrwyFee8ZwKeQU40J",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "button",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " or a ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "70YjtGRCs4BUACjaqQzlDY",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "link",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ", the element changes its appearance. Think of it as a visual response to show users that the element is interactive. ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Possibilities",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-4"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Hover is a easy way to make your design feel more dynamic and engaging. If the appearance of an element changes while hovering, most users understand that this iss somehow an interactive element, and they will try to click it in most cases. ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "The :hover selector can of course be used on all elements, not only on links or buttons.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "On the right you can see how we used the hover selector to style the links on this website using the possibility to animate the italic settings of a ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "1dmTPt3ONqIzoLPuoDUMuT",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "variable font",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ".",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": "document"
    },
    "codeField": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "css\na {\n  font-variation-settings: \"wght\" 250, \"ital\" 0;\n  transition: font-variation-settings letter-spacing .3s ease;\n}\n\n/* when hovered: the italic value increases */\na:hover {\n  font-variation-settings: \"wght\" 250, \"ital\" 12;\n  transition: font-variation-settings letter-spacing .3s ease;\n}",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
